202
00:26:01,854 --> 00:26:04,773
Hola. Soy Cameron.

203
00:26:05,941 --> 00:26:06,952
Kate.

204
00:26:11,238 --> 00:26:12,489
¿La conociste?

205
00:26:13,991 --> 00:26:15,033
Sí, ayer.

206
00:26:17,327 --> 00:26:18,453
